# Normalize line endings to LF for every text file this repo tracks,
# regardless of what a contributor's local core.autocrlf setting does on
# checkin, and regardless of a CI runner's own git defaults on checkout
# (GitHub-hosted windows-latest runners historically default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which converts LF -> CRLF on checkout unless a
# .gitattributes here overrides it). This repo had no .gitattributes at
# all before this file, so a Windows checkout's line endings were left
# entirely to whatever the runner's global git config happened to be.
*                 text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats: never touch line endings, on any platform.
*.png             binary
*.jpg             binary
*.jpeg            binary
*.gif             binary
*.ico             binary
*.woff            binary
*.woff2           binary
*.ttf             binary
